TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water with atmospheric O2
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g) -0.7 10
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -totals Fe S Ca
    -molalities Fe+2 Fe+3
END
